# Abigale, Eloquent First-Year's trigger targets Bot1's own Cecil, Dark Knight; in response Ephemerate exiles Cecil and
# returns it. The Cecil that returned is a new object (CR 400.7), not the target, which is gone, so the trigger does nothing
# (CR 608.2b): the new Cecil keeps deathtouch and has no counters.
# Turn 1: Plains, Mox Jet pays Cecil. Turn 3: Plains, Mox Pearl and a Plains pay Abigale, the other Plains Ephemerate.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Jet
Cecil, Dark Knight
Mox Pearl
Abigale, Eloquent First-Year
Ephemerate
Plains
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cecil, Dark Knight.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Abigale, Eloquent First-Year.Cast
Bot1.Target(Cecil, Dark Knight)
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ephemerate.Cast(Cecil, Dark Knight)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Keywords = Deathtouch
Bot1.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Counters.Flying = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Counters.FirstStrike = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Counters.Lifelink = (absent)
Exile = Ephemerate
